WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.099
Each learning event will help you understand an idea

00:00:03.152 --> 00:00:06.007
before you are asked to use it You will

00:00:06.021 --> 00:00:09.599
hear an explanation explore a worked example and then

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:12.850
practise with a situation that requires your own reasoning

00:00:13.744 --> 00:00:19.428
Fictional Meridian examples demonstrate the method Separate practice situations

00:00:19.455 --> 00:00:22.047
help you transfer that method rather than copy an

00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:26.744
answer Your comparisons and reflections help you recognise what

00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:27.652
you would improve
